<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS2.SSS2.Px2" title="In 6.2.2 Findings ‣ 6.2 Progress Predictions ‣ 6 Analysis ‣ Retrospective Progress-Aware Self-Refinement for LLM Agent Training" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">The task achievement signal is observable.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
